@M_KOJO_EGG_EVENT_K51_CHILD_RAISING_離乳
;-------------------------------------------------
	;Weaning.
	;Always goes the same way. Kappa have one and only one favorite food.
CALL SET_KOJO_COLOR(51)
PRINTFORMDL
IF FIRSTTIME("BabyFood",0,51)
	PRINTFORMDW %CALLNAME:(TALENT:51:育児中)% can now hold %HIS_HER(TALENT:51:育児中)% own head up, and is able to use %HIS_HER(TALENT:51:育児中)% hands well.
	PRINTFORMDW The time is about right. Starting now, you're going to be weaning %HIM_HER(TALENT:51:育児中)% off of breast milk and onto solid food.
	PRINTFORMDW Under Nitori's supervision, you've prepared a baby food mixture made from simple, healthy ingredients, and a good deal of salt.
	PRINTFORMDW Before that, however, the baby's first taste of real food must be a spoonful of mashed cucumber.
	PRINTFORMW 「It's important for %HIM_HER(TALENT:51:育児中)% to develop properly! Everyone knows that!」
	PRINTFORMDW Although %HE_SHE(TALENT:51:育児中)%@'s only half-kappa, it seems you'll be following their traditions.
	PRINTFORMDW You gently insert the spoon into %HIS_HER(TALENT:51:育児中)% mouth...
	PRINTFORMW 「Oh...!」
	PRINTFORMDW Nitori holds her breath as she watches on. The baby's eyes widen, and %HIS_HER(TALENT:51:育児中)% mouth begins to move as you slide the spoon out.
	PRINTFORMDW Then... %HE_SHE(TALENT:51:育児中)%@ smiles.
	PRINTFORMW 「Aaah! %HE_SHE(TALENT:51:育児中)%@ likes it! Look, %HE_SHE(TALENT:51:育児中)%@ likes it!」
	PRINTFORMDW Nitori clings to you excitedly and cheers for the baby while you continue to feed %HIM_HER(TALENT:51:育児中)%...
ELSE
	PRINTFORMDW It's time to start feeding %CALLNAME:(TALENT:51:育児中)% solid food. %SPLIT_G(@"As usual:Naturally:Of course")%, the first %SPLIT_G(@"taste:helping:spoonful")% is a %SPLIT_G(@"small amount:bit:pile")% of mashed cucumber.
	PRINTFORMW 「%SPLIT_G(@"%HE_SHE(TALENT:51:育児中)%@ smiled! Ohhh, look at %HIM_HER(TALENT:51:育児中)% eat it!:%HE_SHE(TALENT:51:育児中)%@ likes it! Look at that smile!:A smile! Heh heh, %HE_SHE(TALENT:51:育児中)%@'s a kappa, all right!:Look at %HIM_HER(TALENT:51:育児中)% go! Give %HIM_HER(TALENT:51:育児中)% some more!")%」
	PRINTFORMDW So far, the weaning is going well...
ENDIF
