@M_KOJO_EGG_EVENT_K51_CHILD_RAISING_玩具
;-------------------------------------------------
	;Playing with toys.
	;Kappa obsession takes root early, so you can tell what kind of hobby they'll have right away. Some are more obvious than others.
CALL SET_KOJO_COLOR(51)
PRINTFORMDL
LOCAL = 0
IF FIRSTTIME("BabyToys",0,51)
	LOCAL = 1
	PRINTFORMW 「It's ready now!」
	PRINTFORMDW Nitori is finished setting up a play area in \@ CFLAG:51:初期位置 == CFLAG:MASTER:初期位置 ?your#her\@ home for %CALLNAME:(TALENT:51:育児中)%. It's just big enough to move around in.
	PRINTL
	PRINTFORMDW Nitori places %HIM_HER(TALENT:51:育児中)% in the middle, surrounded by a number of handmade toys.
	PRINTFORMDW There's a small robot, a stuffed kappa, a painted wooden cucumber, a mechanical hinge, and more... Did Nitori make all of these?
	PRINTL
	PRINTFORMW 「I'm not sure what %HE_SHE(TALENT:51:育児中)%'ll like or what's appropriate, so I thought I'd make a whole bunch and let %HIM_HER(TALENT:51:育児中)% choose!」
	PRINTFORMDW That's a bit overboard... However, it seems that one of them has caught %CHILDNAME:51:(TALENT:51:育児中)%'s eye.
ELSE
	PRINTFORMDW The play area is now ready for %CALLNAME:(TALENT:51:育児中)%. You drop %HIM_HER(TALENT:51:育児中)% in the middle, and wait with Nitori as %HE_SHE(TALENT:51:育児中)% picks out a toy.
ENDIF
SELECTCASE K51_EGG_CHILD_HOBBY(TALENT:51:育児中)
	CASE "Robotics"
		PRINTFORMDW %HIS_HER(TALENT:51:育児中)% hands fall on the robot's remote control, and %HE_SHE(TALENT:51:育児中)%@ studies it closely.
		PRINTFORMDW To give %HIM_HER(TALENT:51:育児中)% an idea, you place a finger on the joystick and push it forward, causing the robot to move.
		PRINTFORMDW %CALLNAME:(TALENT:51:育児中)% makes a shocked face and stares at the robot. You touch the controls some more, and %HE_SHE(TALENT:51:育児中)%@ soon makes the connection.
		PRINTFORMDW It isn't long before %HE_SHE(TALENT:51:育児中)%@'s pushing buttons and moving the stick %HIM_HER(TALENT:51:育児中)%self. You can't help but think that %HE_SHE(TALENT:51:育児中)%@ must be very smart...
		PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(TALENT:51:育児中)%@ stares intently between the remote and the robot, testing the controls for a long time. %HE_SHE(TALENT:51:育児中)%@ doesn't even look at the other toys.
	CASE "Architecture"
		PRINTFORMDW Despite all of the complicated kappa toys around %HIM_HER(TALENT:51:育児中)%, it's a simple hollowed-out turtle shell that finally catches %HIS_HER(TALENT:51:育児中)% eye.
		PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(TALENT:51:育児中)%@ crawls up to it and dips %HIS_HER(TALENT:51:育児中)% head, trying to peer inside. Then, %HE_SHE(TALENT:51:育児中)%@ starts trying to reach in with %HIS_HER(TALENT:51:育児中)% tiny hands.
	CASE "Explosives"
		PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(TALENT:51:育児中)%@ seems particularly attracted to a toy ball. %HE_SHE(TALENT:51:育児中)%@ pushes it to make it roll, then crawls after it, only to repeat the same thing.
		PRINTFORMDW Eventually, %HE_SHE(TALENT:51:育児中)%@ picks it up in both hands and nibbles on it a bit... then pushes it out again, throwing it clumsily across the play area.
	CASE "Weapons"
		PRINTFORMDW He picks up a tiny wrench and feels the top of it with his fingers, studying the complex shape.
		PRINTFORMDW Then he lifts it up and hits it against a wooden block lying nearby, and starts to giggle at the sound it makes.
	CASE "Danmaku"
		PRINTFORMDW She crawls over to some colored blocks and starts picking them up and studying them.
		PRINTFORMDW She turns some of them over, puts them down next to each other, and smiles happily.
	CASE "Vehicles"
		PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(TALENT:51:育児中)%@ picks up a toy boat and studies it.
		PRINTFORMDW Nitori places a bowl of water in front of %HIM_HER(TALENT:51:育児中)%, and puts the boat on top so that %HE_SHE(TALENT:51:育児中)%@ can see it float.
		PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(TALENT:51:育児中)%@ stares at it for a moment before grabbing at it again and dunking it deeper in the water.
ENDSELECT
IF LOCAL
	PRINTL
	PRINTFORMW 「You know what I heard? This is a kind of fortune telling.」
	PRINTFORMW 「Kappa develop lifelong interests very early, so you can tell what they'll be passionate about by letting them explore like this.」
	PRINTFORMDW In other words, you're watching a kappa's eternal obsession take form before your eyes. It's a little intriguing...
	PRINTFORMW 「I don't know if it's true, but I guess we'll find out!」
ENDIF
PRINTFORMDW You and Nitori watch %HIM_HER(TALENT:51:育児中)% play for a while...
